                  <msItem>
                     <title>Galfridus Monemutensis, Historia Brittonum, etc.</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Cotton Vesp. B.x (fols. 1–23) and Cotton Titus
                        A.xviii (Vita s. Brendani and Vita s. Longini militis) formed one volume, of
                        which Cotton fragments xxix (fols. 36–39) were the endleaves. The full
                        table of contents is in Cotton frgms. xxix fol. 37v.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">(fol. 14r) "historia Brittonum. secundo folio
                        cum in uinculis".</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">For another inscription see Cotton frgms. xxix
                        fol. 37v. </note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
